      "competitor_id": "ninedot-energy",
      "name": "NineDot Energy",
      "tier": 1,
      "description": "NineDot Energy is a leading distributed BESS developer in New York City, having closed US$431 million in construction financing for a portfolio of 28 community-scale battery energy storage systems totaling 124 MW/494 MWh across NYC. The company has enrolled 300 MW of operating and in-development projects in the Statewide Solar for All program, estimating US$60 million in contributions over a decade, and actively monetizes assets through VDER Value Stack and NYISO DER aggregation pathways. NineDot's scale, financing sophistication\u2014including tax-credit-transfer bridge facilities\u2014and deep regulatory engagement make it the most formidable direct competitor for NEE in the downstate distributed BESS market.",
