      "competitor_id": "cleancapital",
      "name": "CleanCapital",
      "tier": 1,
      "description": "CleanCapital is an active acquirer and joint venture partner in New York's distributed BESS market, having completed a 2026 JV acquisition of a 7.7 MW/30.8 MWh VDER-participating portfolio in Staten Island. Its role as a capital partner and asset acquirer positions it simultaneously as a potential buyer for NEE's developed projects and as a direct competitor for site control and deal flow in constrained downstate geographies. CleanCapital's demonstrated appetite for VDER-enrolled distributed storage validates acquirer demand in New York City and signals that it will continue competing for similar assets.",
