      "competitor_id": "cpower",
      "name": "CPower",
      "tier": 2,
      "description": "CPower is a demand response and distributed energy aggregator that monetizes flexible capacity\u2014including battery storage\u2014through NYISO-administered energy, capacity, and ancillary service markets. Operating as a substitute revenue pathway provider, CPower competes with direct BESS developers by offering aggregation contracts that can serve as an alternative monetization or exit strategy for distributed storage assets. Its established relationships with NYISO and its customer base in New York make it a significant market participant that NEE must consider both as a potential partner and as a competitive force.",
