    {
      "competitor_id": "voltus",
      "name": "Voltus",
      "tier": 2,
      "description": "Voltus is a distributed energy resource aggregator that enables battery storage and other flexible assets to participate in NYISO's DER aggregation model, accessing energy, capacity, and ancillary service revenues. Like CPower, Voltus offers a substitute pathway for BESS monetization and competes with developers for the economic value embedded in distributed storage assets by capturing aggregation margins. The company is explicitly cited in the report as both a potential NEE partner and an aggregator shaping the competitive landscape for distributed BESS revenue in New York.",
